      },
      "message": "fix(post): take the coincident arc guard in richauto.cps\n\nThe RichAuto post wrote an arc block whose written end was its written\nstart. The A11 reads such a block as a full circle (#3442, #3474).\nonCircular now asks the PRELUDE guard arcFate with the words that this\npost writes: work coordinates, three decimals, incremental centres. A\nshort arc under the output step posts as its straight feed move, or as\nno block. The refusals of onCircular stay before the guard.\n\nPins: richauto rows in coincident_arcs and same_angle_arcs, and\nrichauto_safety::an_arc_under_the_output_step_is_no_arc_block. The arc\nreader of coincident_arcs now reads the compact block form.\n\nRefs #1914\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
